## Install

From another directory, install this package using its absolute path:

```sh
pi install /absolute/path/to/this-directory
```

Local packages are loaded in place, not copied. Keep this directory after
installing. Restart Pi (or run `/reload`) to load the skills.

To try it for one session without changing settings:

```sh
pi -e /absolute/path/to/this-directory
```

You can also publish this directory to npm and install it with
`pi install npm:{{ .Plugin.Name }}`, or commit it as a standalone Git repository
and install with `pi install git:github.com/owner/repo`. Publishing to npm
requires a valid npm package name and semantic version.

